From: schopde-nvidia
Subject: [PATCH] [Kernel] Allow steering the unquantized linear backend independently

Upstream-PR: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/59021
Upstream-Commit: 0d1a683a3471ce352ef5a9aa2d7a9616bd1ac4bf
